ChatR Labs Uncensored Omni LoRA v0.1 is an independently fine-tuned adapter for
Qwen-Image-2.1. The adapter modifies transformer attention and feed-forward
layers through rank-64 low-rank updates. The published epoch-3 weights were
converted from Kohya-style FP32 keys to Diffusers/PEFT keys and BF16 precision,
with alpha/rank folded into lora_B. The base model is not bundled in this release.

The inference example and model card were prepared for this adapter release.
